nd`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"246d88ef5c1078d27705e0b71510fb18","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"24998285e886ee30f230af3b53c0be08","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"49e0dc750ea6aa8f02230266e545fc99","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"dce172d917872044f28f609fea461960","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"09eb7bfb507842c9d9b99e187b206e72","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2726d5df0b590b0c1caf3f3dd901e995","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"8fb413504c69e7f02da7e1580110281e","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"1682de6b64f71a6dd3843ea5d5769355","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"11fb4d4c52f0d02ed8f80e6d3f196e14","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794939725784,"stop":1794939725887,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value"